-commons-runtime/index.json:24:    \"description\" : \"Provides the runtime portion of iStack Commons, a small set of shared utility classes used by JAXB and related Java XML and web-services components. It includes reusable support for annotations, localization, logging, XML and SAX helpers, and other common infrastructure.\",\nmetadata/com.sun.istack/istack-commons-tools/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"iStack Commons Tools provides tool-time utility classes for Java applications, including classloader helpers, authenticator support, and protected Ant task execution used by JAXB-related tooling. It is part of Eclipse iStack Common Utility Code and complements the runtime utilities with support code intended for build-time and tooling scenarios.\",\nmetadata/org.keycloak/keycloak-admin-client/26.0.9/reachability-metadata.json:180:      \"type\" : \"jakarta.xml.bind.JAXBElement\"\nmetadata/org.keycloak/keycloak-admin-client/26.0.9/reachability-metadata.json:294:      \"type\" : \"org.jboss.resteasy.plugins.providers.jaxb.AbstractJAXBContextFinder\",\nmetadata/org.keycloak/keycloak-admin-client/26.0.9/reachability-metadata.json:305:      \"type\" : \"org.jboss.resteasy.plugins.providers.jaxb.AbstractJAXBProvider\",\nmetadata/org.keycloak/keycloak-admin-client/26.0.9/reachability-metadata.json:327:      \"type\" : \"org.jboss.resteasy.plugins.providers.jaxb.JAXBContextFinder\"\nmetadata/com.sun.jersey/jersey-core/1.9/reachability-metadata.json:320:          \"javax.xml.bind.annotation.XmlRootElement\"\nmetadata/org.jvnet.staxex/stax-ex/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"stax-ex extends the JSR-173 StAX API with support for parser reuse, non-text XML infosets, and improved namespace handling. It provides Java interfaces and helpers used by JAXB and Metro to stream XML data efficiently, including binary content.\",\nmetadata/org.jvnet.staxex/stax-ex/index.json:25:    \"description\" : \"stax-ex extends the JSR-173 StAX API with utilities for higher-performance XML streaming and parser reuse. It also improves handling of non-text XML infosets and namespace processing for JAXB and Metro use cases.\",\nmetadata/org.springframework.boot/spring-boot-starter-json/index.json:5:    \"replacement\": \"Use class-bearing dependencies such as org.springframework:spring-web:5.3.31, com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind:2.13.5, com.fasterxml.jackson.datatype:jackson-datatype-jdk8:2.13.5, com.fasterxml.jackson.datatype:jackson-datatype-jsr310:2.13.5, and com.fasterxml.jackson.module:jackson-module-parameter-names:2.13.5.\"\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jaxrs/jackson-jaxrs-json-provider/index.json:9:    \"description\" : \"Jackson JAX-RS JSON Provider integrates Jackson databinding with JAX-RS implementations such as Jersey and RESTEasy to read and write JSON request and response bodies. It supplies MessageBodyReader and MessageBodyWriter providers plus related JSON/JAXB configuration support for REST endpoints.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jaxrs/jackson-jaxrs-json-provider/index.json:24:    \"description\" : \"Jackson JAX-RS JSON Provider integrates Jackson databinding with JAX-RS implementations such as Jersey and RESTEasy to read and write JSON request and response bodies. It supplies MessageBodyReader and MessageBodyWriter providers plus related JSON/JAXB configuration support for REST endpoints.\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jaxrs/jackson-jaxrs-json-provider/2.22.0/reachability-metadata.json:7:      \"type\" : \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.jaxb.JaxbAnnotationIntrospector\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.jaxrs/jackson-jaxrs-json-provider/2.9.8/reachability-metadata.json:13:      \"type\": \"com.fasterxml.jackson.module.jaxb.JaxbAnnotationIntrospector\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.datatype/jackson-datatype-jsr310/index.json:7:    \"repository-url\" : \"https://github.com/FasterXML/jackson-modules-java8\",\nmetadata/com.fasterxml.jackson.datatype/jackson-datatype-jsr310/index.json:8:    \"test-code-url\" : \"htt